  "configuration_id": "config_018",
  "reason": "Evidence: RNA-only with multiprofile + pca_n2000 + avgpool (config_002, acc=0.591) is the strongest result so far, while image-only with resnet50 (config_010, acc=0.208) is very weak. The critical unresolved question for a multimodal cellular profiling study is whether adding the image modality via fusion provides any complementary signal beyond the already-strong RNA features. config_018 (multimodal, multiprofile, pca_n2000, resnet50, avgpool, concat) is the direct multimodal extension of the best RNA-only config, isolating the effect of image addition with the simplest (concat) fusion. This is the highest-information next experiment: if it beats 0.591, it justifies further exploration of fusion strategies and image encoders; if it does not, it tells us to concentrate remaining budget on RNA encoder and aggregation refinements rather than the full 36-config multimodal grid. It is the best use of one experiment because it resolves the single most important design decision (multimodal vs. unimodal) before committing budget to finer-grained variations."
}

